<title>USA: Triangle Bancorp Inc Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Triangle Bancorp Inc Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.27		    $0.22</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.27		     0.22</p>
<p> Net			  2,931		    2,317</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	10,813		   10,716</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	10,824		   10,756</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.05		    $0.74</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.04		     0.73</p>
<p> Net			 11,301		    7,858</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	10,778		   10,591</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	10,830		   10,704</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Total assets at December 31, 1996 were $971.1 million versus $853.9 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 provision for loan losses at December 31 was $765,000 versus $158,000 at 1995 Q4 December 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
